# oracle: fix dt/reset on an LJ melt: the timestep is recomputed every 5 steps from Xmax and emax; thermo dt, time, pe, ke over 60 steps
# (a 200-step run of this hot melt with dt up to 0.05 amplifies round-off to about 1e-3 in the forces; 60 steps keep it near round-off)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units lj
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 0.8442
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
velocity all create 3.0 87287
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
fix 1 all nve
timestep 0.005
fix 5 all dt/reset 5 NULL 0.05 0.1 units box emax 20
thermo_style custom step dt time pe ke f_5
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo 5
run 60
